			<div class="content" id="post-content-3685759">
									

<p>Here we go again.</p>
<p>Pic is from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Donini_dry_cleaning_machines_(Bologna)_3.jpg">here</a>.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
