<p>Ryan North - for writing <a href="http://qwantz.com/index.php?comic=1455">this comic</a> whose last panel partially inspired this skip</p>
<p>Whichever person in chat who brought up &quot;meat-eating bacteria&quot;, leading me to consider &quot;meat, eating bacteria&quot; and subsequently &quot;people, eating bacteria&quot;</p>
<p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3122708); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3122708&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1516343217" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3122708)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3122708); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> - for brainstorming assistance</p>
